  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcCharts .NET: all eight series types (line, fast line, step line, area, bar/column, scatter, candlestick, OHLC), views, headless renderer, data sources and interaction, with no functional limits. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. The financial pack (panes, indicators, volume, aggregator, drawing tools) and the sgcWebSockets bridge are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
